/* generated from forallI : {A,P}({x:tm A}ded (P x))⟶ded (forall A [x]P x) */

ded X2 (forall A x \ P x) :- help/forallI A P X1 X2 , (pi x \ ded (X1 x) (P x)).

help/forallI A P (x \ pair (X1/1 x) (X1/2 x)) (pair X2/1 X2/2) :- help/forallI/1 A P X1/1 X2/1 , help/forallI/2 A P X1/2 X2/2.

/* generated from forallE : {A,P}ded (forall A P)⟶{x:tm A}ded (P x) */

